# Every text file in this repository is stored with LF, so say so explicitly.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf writes CRLF into the working tree while cargo, the
# Tauri CLI, npm and bun all write LF. Anything those tools regenerate then reads
# as permanently modified: it blocked branch switches repeatedly and produced
# merge diffs that rewrote entire files without changing a line of content.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The bundled game-data snapshot is a pair of gzip streams.
src-tauri/resources/game-data/*.gz binary
